{"nodes": [{"id": "services_answer_validator_verifyanswer", "label": "verifyAnswer (dispatch QCM vs texte libre)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L18-L25", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "services_answer_validator_verifyqcmanswer", "label": "verifyQcmAnswer", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L27-L75", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "services_answer_validator_verifyfreetextanswer", "label": "verifyFreeTextAnswer", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L77-L95", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "services_answer_validator_checkmatch", "label": "checkMatch (tolerance de correspondance texte libre)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L97-L150", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "services_answer_validator_validationresult", "label": "ValidationResult (valid vs isCorrect)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L7-L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Union a deux niveaux qui separe 'ce message est-il une tentative de reponse' de 'la tentative est-elle juste'. { valid: false } laisse l'appelant ignorer le message (chat bavard en QCM) sans consommer la tentative du joueur; { valid: true, isCorrect: false } consomme la tentative. En texte libre tout message est une tentative valide, donc verifyFreeTextAnswer ne retourne jamais valid: false."}, {"id": "services_answer_validator_qcm_strict_single_token", "label": "QCM mono-reponse: token strict uniquement", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L35-L48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "En QCM mono-reponse seul le message strictement egal a une lettre (A-F) ou un chiffre (1-N) compte: pas de mots autour, pas de split sur les espaces, sinon n'importe quelle phrase du chat contenant un 'A' validerait. Exception deliberee: une suite de lettres valides ('AB') est acceptee comme tentative fausse plutot qu'ignoree, pour consommer l'essai et empecher le retry immediat. Le multi-reponses relache cette regle et tokenise sur espaces et virgules."}, {"id": "services_answer_validator_fuzzy_tolerance_ladder", "label": "Echelle de tolerance texte libre (exact -> substring -> Sorensen-Dice)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L100-L149", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cascade du plus strict au plus permissif: egalite exacte (avec/sans articles), puis garde numerique (si la reponse contient des chiffres ils doivent correspondre exactement, sinon '1789' matcherait '1798'), puis inclusion de sous-chaine bornee, puis Sorensen-Dice a 0.70 sans articles / 0.75 brut. Le sens inverse de l'inclusion (proposition contenant la reponse) a ete retire car il validait tout texte contenant le mot-reponse, y compris la question elle-meme retapee; les variantes connues doivent passer par ALT:. Le flag strictSpelling court-circuite toute la cascade apres l'exact match."}], "edges": [{"source": "services_answer_validator_verifyanswer", "target": "services_answer_validator_verifyqcmanswer", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_verifyanswer", "target": "services_answer_validator_verifyfreetextanswer", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L24", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_verifyfreetextanswer", "target": "services_answer_validator_checkmatch", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L84-L89", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_qcm_strict_single_token", "target": "services_answer_validator_verifyqcmanswer", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L35-L48", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_fuzzy_tolerance_ladder", "target": "services_answer_validator_checkmatch", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L100-L149", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_verifyqcmanswer", "target": "services_answer_validator_validationresult", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L27", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_verifyfreetextanswer", "target": "services_answer_validator_validationresult", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": "L77", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "services_answer_validator_verifyqcmanswer", "target": "services_answer_validator_verifyfreetextanswer", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "answer_validation_contract", "label": "Contrat de validation de reponse (valid vs isCorrect)", "nodes": ["services_answer_validator_validationresult", "services_answer_validator_verifyanswer", "services_answer_validator_verifyqcmanswer", "services_answer_validator_verifyfreetextanswer", "services_answer_validator_checkmatch"], "relation": "implement", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/services/answer-validator.ts"}]}